sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant API as Evaluation API
    participant W as Worker
    participant LG as LLM Gateway
    UI->>API: Request quality judgment {judge model, embedding, criteria set}
    API->>API: Snapshot criteria · store model · switch to judgment phase
    API-->>UI: Accepted
    W->>W: Wait for a global queue slot (shown as "judging · queued")
    W->>W: Claim (pending → running · attempt +1) · judge round +1
    loop Per judged row
        W->>W: Assemble judge input — question / answer / passages / reference
        W->>LG: Call 4 RAGAS-family metrics (JSON-parse retries)
        alt Scores obtained
            W->>W: Classify verdict
        else Retries exhausted
            W->>W: Not judgeable — excluded from aggregates
        end
        W->>W: Overwrite judgment + round marker
    end
    W->>W: Judged · summary frozen
